# Raw App Store / Play Store preview video captures (scripts/take_video*.sh).
# Unlike screenshots/ (small, final-form PNGs committed for reference), raw
# .mov/.mp4 captures are large, get trimmed/edited before actual use, and
# are regenerable on demand from integration_test/video_walkthrough_test.dart
# — so they stay local/CI artifacts rather than repo history. Upload the
# edited result to App Store Connect directly, or to YouTube for the Play
# Store "Video" field (see scripts/take_video_android.sh).
/videos/

# scripts/release/build_release_kit.sh output — a scratch assembly of
# generated release notes + a snapshot of screenshots/videos for one release
# range. Reviewed notes get copied by hand into CHANGELOG.md and
# docs/store-listing.md; screenshots/videos are sourced from their own
# directories above. See docs/release-kit.md.
/release-kit/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
# VS Code which you may wish to be included in version control, so this line
# is commented out by default.
#.vscode/

